# Raw release CSVs (build-time inputs to python/build_embeddings.py) and
# non-active dictionary parquets are excluded dynamically by deploy.sh —
# it reads the active release from config.yml and drops everything else
# matching dd-abcd-*.{csv,parquet} from the bundle. Keeping that logic in
# one place avoids per-release edits here (.rscignore has no glob support).
